Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: MissionDebug ROS 2 agent
 Local-first debugger for ROS 2 robots. Subscribes to configured topics,
 keeps a 60-second rolling buffer in RAM, and saves an MCAP session on
 manual trigger or anomaly (stall, path deviation).
